<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115547" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδο-ποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>misrepresent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ εὐεργετήματα . . τῶν ἄλλων
					ἐπειρᾶτο ψευδοποιεῖν καὶ ταπεινοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					30.4.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>give the lie to, expose as false,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἀποφάσεις τῶν ποιητῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					12.25.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				12.25c
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				24
			</span></i>; folld. by acc. et inf., <i>stigmatize as
				false</i> the doctrine that . . , <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.87S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be deceived</i> or <i>mistaken, err,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴσθησις -εῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					4.9.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
